function crewViz(){const R=[["Excavation",2],["Electrical",1],["Plumbing",1],["Concrete",3],["Fencing",1]];let y=18;return`<svg viewBox="0 0 300 220" class="cviz">${R.map(([t,n],i)=>{const yy=y+i*40;return`<g class="cv-row" style="--d:${i*.12}s"><text x="0" y="${yy+16}" class="cv-t">${t}</text>${Array.from({length:n},(_,k)=>`<circle cx="${150+k*34}" cy="${yy+11}" r="13" class="cv-s ${k<(i%2?n:n-1)?"on":""}" style="--d:${i*.12+k*.1}s"/>`).join("")}</g>`}).join("")}</svg>`}
VIEWS.project=(id,q)=>{const p=PJ(id);if(!p)return VIEWS.notfound();const m=me(),owner=m&&m.id===p.pm,crew=crewOf(p),onCrew=m&&crew.includes(m.id),pm=U(p.pm),s=slots(p);const tab=owner?(q.tab||"crew"):(q.tab||"overview");const pa=pendingApps(p);
 const tabs=owner?[["crew","Crew roster"],["applicants",`Applicants${pa?` (${pa})`:""}`],["messages","Crew chat"],["overview","Overview"]]:onCrew?[["overview","Overview"],["messages","Crew chat"]]:[];
 const head=`<div class="pjhead"><a class="backlink" href="${href(owner?"dash":"projects")}">${I("back",16)}${owner?"Dashboard":"All projects"}</a><div class="pjbanner">${projArt(p.type,p.title)}</div><div class="pjh-row"><div><span class="kick">${I(PTPL[p.type]?PTPL[p.type].icon:"layers",14)} ${esc((PTPL[p.type]||PTPL.custom).t)} · ${p.status==="completed"?"Complete":p.status==="active"?"In progress":"Hiring crew"}</span><h1>${esc(p.title)}</h1><p class="muted">${I("pin",14)} ${esc(townOf(p.zip))} · ${I("clock",14)} ${fmtD(p.start)} – ${fmtD(p.end)} · ${I("dollar",14)} ${esc(p.budget)} · PM: <b>${esc(nameOf(pm))}</b></p></div>${owner?`<div class="pjstats"><div><b>${s.f}/${s.n}</b><small>crew filled</small></div><div><b>${pa}</b><small>applicants</small></div><div><b>${Math.min(p.phase+1,p.phases.length)}/${p.phases.length}</b><small>phase</small></div></div>`:""}</div>${phaseLine(p)}${owner&&p.status!=="completed"?`<div class="row wrapr"><button class="btn" id="advPhase">${I("check",16)}${p.phase>=p.phases.length-1?"Mark project complete":"Finish “"+esc(p.phases[p.phase])+"” → next phase"}</button><a class="btn ghost" href="${href("project",p.id,{tab:"messages"})}">${I("chat",16)}Message crew</a></div>`:""}${tabs.length?`<div class="pjtabs" role="tablist">${tabs.map(([k,t])=>`<a role="tab" aria-selected="${tab===k}" class="${tab===k?"on":""}" href="${href("project",p.id,{tab:k})}">${t}</a>`).join("")}</div>`:""}</div>`;
 let body="";
 if(tab==="messages"&&(owner||onCrew)){const ms=DB.pmsgs.filter(x=>x.pid===p.id&&(x.to==="all"||x.to===m.id||x.from===m.id)).sort((a,b)=>a.date-b.date);const people=[p.pm,...crew].filter(x=>x!==m.id);
  body=`<div class="crewchat card"><div class="bubbles" id="pbub">${ms.map(x=>{const u=U(x.from),mine=x.from===m.id;return`<div class="bub ${mine?"me":""}">${mine?"":`<b class="bwho">${esc(nameOf(u))}</b>`}<span class="bto">${x.to==="all"?"To whole crew":"Private"+(mine?" · to "+esc(nameOf(U(x.to))):"")}</span><p>${esc(x.text)}</p><time>${ago(x.date)}</time></div>`}).join("")||`<p class="muted">No messages yet. Say hi to the crew.</p>`}</div><form id="pmf" class="sendrow"><label class="sr" for="pmTo">Send to</label><select id="pmTo" name="to"><option value="all">Whole crew (${crew.length+1})</option>${people.map(c=>`<option value="${c}">${esc(nameOf(U(c)))}</option>`).join("")}</select><label class="sr" for="pmTxt">Message</label><input id="pmTxt" name="text" placeholder="Message the crew…" autocomplete="off"><button class="btn primary" aria-label="Send">${I("send",18)}</button></form></div>`}
 else if(tab==="applicants"&&owner){const rows=p.roles.flatMap(r=>r.apps.filter(a=>a.status==="pending"||a.status==="waitlist").map(a=>({r,a})));body=rows.length?`<div class="applist">${rows.map(({r,a})=>{const u=U(a.cid),rt=rating(a.cid),full=r.filled.length>=r.need;return`<article class="appcard card">${avatar(u)}<div class="ap-m"><b><a href="${href("pro",u.id)}">${esc(u.biz)}</a></b><span class="muted small">${esc(u.trade)} · ${rt.n?"★ "+rt.avg.toFixed(1)+" ("+rt.n+")":"New"} · ${dist(p.zip,u.zip)} mi${u.verified?" · Verified":""}</span><span class="badge">For: ${esc(r.label)} · ${r.filled.length}/${r.need}</span>${a.note?`<p>“${esc(a.note)}”</p>`:""}</div><div class="ap-a"><button class="btn primary sm" data-accept="${r.id}:${u.id}" ${full?"disabled":""}>${I("check",14)}${full?"Role full":"Accept"}</button><button class="btn ghost sm" data-decline="${r.id}:${u.id}">Decline</button><button class="btn ghost sm" data-dm="${u.id}" aria-label="Message ${esc(u.biz)}">${I("chat",14)}</button></div></article>`}).join("")}</div>`:empty("users","No pending applicants","Matching pros were notified. Applications show up here.","")}
 else if(tab==="crew"&&owner){body=`<div class="roster">${p.roles.map(r=>`<section class="rrole card"><header><div><b>${esc(r.label)}</b><span class="muted small">${esc(r.trade)}</span></div>${slotDots(r)}<span class="rcount ${r.filled.length>=r.need?"full":""}">${r.filled.length}/${r.need}</span></header>${r.filled.map(c=>{const u=U(c),done=r.done.includes(c),rv=DB.reviews.find(x=>x.proj===p.id&&x.role===r.id&&x.cid===c);return`<div class="member">${avatar(u,"sm")}<a href="${href("pro",c)}">${esc(u.biz)}</a><span class="mstat ${done?"done":""}">${done?"Part complete":"On site"}</span><span class="mact">${!done?`<button class="btn sm" data-done="${r.id}:${c}">${I("check",14)}Mark part complete</button>`:rv?`<span class="small">${starStr(rv.stars)} reviewed</span>`:`<button class="btn primary sm" data-revcrew="${r.id}:${c}">${I("star",14)}Review</button>`}<button class="iconbtn sm" data-dm="${c}" aria-label="Message ${esc(u.biz)}">${I("chat",16)}</button></span></div>`}).join("")}${r.filled.length<r.need?`<p class="muted small open">${r.need-r.filled.length} open · ${r.apps.filter(a=>a.status==="pending").length} applicant(s) ${r.apps.some(a=>a.status==="pending")?`<a href="${href("project",p.id,{tab:"applicants"})}">Review</a>`:""}</p>`:""}</section>`).join("")}</div>`}
 else{body=`<div class="pjgrid"><div><h2 class="h-sub">About the project</h2><p>${esc(p.desc)}</p><h2 class="h-sub">Crew needed</h2><div class="roster">${p.roles.map(r=>{const full=r.filled.length>=r.need,app=m&&r.apps.find(a=>a.cid===m.id&&a.status==="pending"),in_=m&&r.filled.includes(m.id);return`<section class="rrole card"><header><div><b>${esc(r.label)}</b><span class="muted small">${esc(r.trade)}</span></div>${slotDots(r)}<span class="rcount ${full?"full":""}">${r.filled.length}/${r.need}</span></header><div class="rfoot">${in_?`<span class="badge b-ver">${I("check",12)}You're on this crew</span>`:app?`<span class="badge b-fast">${I("clock",12)}Applied, awaiting PM</span>`:full?`<span class="muted small">Filled</span>`:owner?`<span class="muted small">${r.need-r.filled.length} open</span>`:`<button class="btn ${m&&m.role==="contractor"&&m.trade===r.trade?"primary":""} sm" data-apply="${r.id}">${I("plus",14)}Apply for this slot</button>`}</div></section>`}).join("")}</div></div><aside class="card pjside"><h2 class="h-sub">Project manager</h2><div class="row">${avatar(pm)}<div><b>${esc(nameOf(pm))}</b><div class="muted small">${esc(pm.name)} · ${esc(townOf(pm.zip))}</div></div></div><p class="small">${esc(pm.bio||"")}</p><ul class="ticks small"><li>${I("check",14)}Crews are reviewed after their part is complete</li><li>${I("check",14)}No lead fees to apply</li><li>${I("check",14)}Group and private crew chat</li></ul>${m&&m.role==="contractor"&&!onCrew?`<a class="btn block" href="${href("projects",null,{trade:m.trade,open:"1"})}">More ${esc(m.trade)} openings</a>`:""}</aside></div>`}
 return`<section class="page project">${head}${body}</section>`};
